{"step_index":76,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:53:17Z","input_tokens":10883,"cache_read_tokens":196288,"output_tokens":3354,"thinking":"Let's design a user-friendly, light-themed interface for the \"Teach Me This Code\" component. The design will be implemented in `index.html` and `styles.css`.\n\n\nLight theme design prioritized with readability and minimal distractions. The three screen areas will focus on code display with line highlighting, a teaching section for step-by-step explanations, and an optional code editor for custom inputs. Ensuring that the teaching area starts with a succinct overview of the code's purpose is important.\n\n\nInitialization of a variable `c` is the first step, setting it to zero to accumulate the current section's sum. The current number, -2, is added to `c`, resulting in `c` becoming -2. The variable `ans` stores the largest sum seen so far; currently set to -2.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Teach Me This Code — Step-by-Step Python Teacher</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Clean, Simple Top Navigation Bar -->\n  <header class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand-area\">\n      <span class=\"teacher-badge\">Teach Me This Code</span>\n      <span id=\"stepProgressLabel\" class=\"step-progress-label\">Step 1 of 50</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Simple Navigation Controls (Section 5) -->\n    <nav class=\"nav-controls\" aria-label=\"Step Navigation\">\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Go back one step (Left Arrow)\">← Previous</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n      <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n      <button id=\"btnToggleCustom\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Change Input / Code</button>\n      <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Optional Collapsible Bar for Custom Code / Input Playground (Hidden by Default) -->\n  <section id=\"customInputDrawer\" class=\"custom-drawer hidden\">\n    <div class=\"custom-drawer-inner\">\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"presetSelect\">Example:</label>\n        <select id=\"presetSelect\" class=\"drawer-select\"></select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"inputPlaygroundField\">Input List:</label>\n        <input id=\"inputPlaygroundField\" type=\"text\" class=\"drawer-input\" value=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\" spellcheck=\"false\" />\n        <button id=\"btnRunInput\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">Apply</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\">Default (→ 6)</button>\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"nums = [-5, -2, -8]\">All Negative (→ -2)</button>\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"nums = [1, 2, 3, 4]\">All Positive (→ 10)</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Edit Python Code</button>\n        <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary hidden\">Run Edited Code</button>\n        <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Reset Default</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Simple Overview Banner -->\n  <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n    <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n    <span id=\"overviewText\">This code finds the largest sum you can get from a continuous section of the list.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       MAIN 3-AREA BEGINNER WORKSPACE\n       1. Your Code (Left)\n       2. Step-by-Step Teaching Area (Center — Main Focus)\n       3. Variable Values (Right)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <main class=\"three-area-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-code\" aria-label=\"Your Code\">\n      <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Your Code</h2>\n\n      <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-view\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Optional Code Editor Textarea when user clicks \"Edit Python Code\" -->\n      <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n        <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 2: TEACHING AREA (CENTER — MAIN FOCUS) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-teaching\" aria-label=\"Step-by-Step Explanation\">\n      <div class=\"teaching-card-inner\">\n\n        <!-- Step Heading -->\n        <h1 id=\"teachStepTitle\" class=\"teach-step-title\">Step 1: Create the variable</h1>\n\n        <!-- Current Code Line Box -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Code:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachCodeBox\" class=\"teach-code-box\">c = 0</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown (Shown on arithmetic / condition / loop steps) -->\n        <div id=\"teachCalculationBox\" class=\"teach-calc-box hidden\">\n          <div id=\"calcCurrentNumRow\" class=\"calc-row hidden\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Current number:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcCurrentNumVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Before:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcBeforeVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Calculation:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcFormulaVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-highlight\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">After:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcAfterVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-after\"></code>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What does this mean? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What does this mean?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachMeaningText\" class=\"teach-meaning-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Variable values now -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Variable values now:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachVarsNowBox\" class=\"teach-vars-now\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What happens next? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section teach-next-box\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What happens next?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachNextText\" class=\"teach-next-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Final Answer Celebration Banner (Shown on final return step) -->\n        <div id=\"finalAnswerBanner\" class=\"final-answer-banner hidden\">\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerHeading\" class=\"final-answer-heading\">Final answer: 6</div>\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerDetail\" class=\"final-answer-detail\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 3: VARIABLE VALUES (RIGHT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-variables\" aria-label=\"Variable Values\">\n      <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Variable Values</h2>\n\n      <table class=\"simple-var-table\" aria-label=\"Current Variable Values\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Variable</th>\n            <th>Current value</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"varInspectorTbody\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- Clean Visual List Box for `nums` showing which number is currently active -->\n      <div id=\"visualListsContainer\" class=\"visual-list-wrap\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (Hidden by Default)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"advancedViewPanel\" class=\"advanced-drawer hidden\" aria-label=\"Advanced Debugging View\">\n    <div class=\"advanced-header\">\n      <strong>Advanced Debugging Details</strong>\n      <span id=\"advMetadataLabel\" class=\"adv-meta\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"advanced-grid\">\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Technical Explanation</div>\n        <div id=\"advTechnicalText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Python Symbols on This Line</div>\n        <div id=\"advSymbolsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Variables Before → After (With Types)</div>\n        <div id=\"advFullVarsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Execution Flowchart</div>\n        <div id=\"flowchartSvgWrap\" class=\"adv-flowchart\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script src=\"engine.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"explainer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Redesign index.html into the clean 3-area \"Teach Me This Code\" beginner interface with optional Advanced View","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\index.html","toolAction":"Redesigning index.html to Teach Me This Code layout","toolSummary":"Redesign index.html with 3-area beginner layout and optional Advanced View"}}]}
