{"step_index":78,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:53:57Z","input_tokens":6190,"cache_read_tokens":204489,"output_tokens":5840,"thinking":"The goal is to create a stylesheet that is easily readable and approachable for beginners. This involves a light background, large text size, ample spacing, and a clear visual cue to highlight the currently executing code line. The \"Next Step\" button needs to be visually prominent.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n  --bg-page: #f8fafc;\n  --bg-card: #ffffff;\n  --bg-subtle: #f1f5f9;\n  --bg-code: #f8fafc;\n\n  --border-light: #e2e8f0;\n  --border-medium: #cbd5e1;\n\n  --text-main: #0f172a;\n  --text-secondary: #475569;\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n\n  --primary-blue: #2563eb;\n  --primary-blue-hover: #1d4ed8;\n  --primary-blue-soft: #eff6ff;\n  --primary-blue-border: #93c5fd;\n\n  --changed-green-bg: #ecfdf5;\n  --changed-green-border: #6ee7b7;\n  --changed-green-text: #065f46;\n\n  --current-line-bg: #dbeafe;\n  --current-line-border: #2563eb;\n\n  /* Light-theme syntax colors */\n  --syn-kw: #7c3aed;\n  --syn-bi: #0284c7;\n  --syn-str: #059669;\n  --syn-num: #d97706;\n  --syn-com: #94a3b8;\n\n  --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', Consolas, monospace;\n\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n  --radius-md: 12px;\n  --radius-lg: 16px;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: var(--bg-page);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   TOP NAVIGATION BAR\n   ========================================================= */\n.top-bar {\n  height: 68px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-card);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 0 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 20px;\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 20;\n}\n\n.brand-area {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.teacher-badge {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.step-progress-label {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background: var(--primary-blue-soft);\n  border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue-border);\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.nav-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn-nav {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 9px 18px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-nav:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.btn-nav:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.btn-next-prominent {\n  background: var(--primary-blue);\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 10px 26px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-next-prominent:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--primary-blue-hover);\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue-hover);\n}\n\n.secondary-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-subtle {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  padding: 7px 12px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn-subtle:hover,\n.btn-subtle.active {\n  background: #e2e8f0;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.btn-small-primary {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: none;\n  background: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   OPTIONAL CUSTOM INPUT / CODE DRAWER\n   ========================================================= */\n.custom-drawer {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n}\n\n.custom-drawer-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.drawer-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.drawer-label {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.drawer-select,\n.drawer-input {\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.drawer-input {\n  width: 280px;\n}\n\n.chip-input {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  padding: 5px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.chip-input:hover {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.validation-banner {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   SIMPLE OVERVIEW BANNER\n   ========================================================= */\n.overview-strip {\n  background: var(--primary-blue-soft);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #dbeafe;\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #1e3a8a;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.overview-label {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  background: #2563eb;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   MAIN 3-AREA WORKSPACE\n   ========================================================= */\n.three-area-workspace {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.45fr 0.9fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n  padding: 22px 28px;\n  max-width: 1560px;\n  width: 100%;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.area-card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 22px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\n}\n\n.area-heading {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  padding-bottom: 10px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT)\n   ========================================================= */\n.code-view {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  background: var(--bg-code);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}\n\n.code-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 2px 14px 2px 0;\n  border-left: 4px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n/* Keep remaining code visible but slightly less prominent */\n.code-row.is-dimmed {\n  opacity: 0.58;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-dimmed:hover {\n  opacity: 0.9;\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n/* Highlight ONLY the current line prominently */\n.code-row.is-current-line {\n  opacity: 1;\n  background-color: var(--current-line-bg);\n  border-left-color: var(--current-line-border);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.code-gutter {\n  width: 46px;\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  user-select: none;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.is-current-line .code-gutter {\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.code-syntax {\n  white-space: pre;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.syn-kw { color: var(--syn-kw); font-weight: 600; }\n.syn-bi { color: var(--syn-bi); }\n.syn-str { color: var(--syn-str); }\n.syn-num { color: var(--syn-num); }\n.syn-com { color: var(--syn-com); font-style: italic; }\n\n.live-editor-wrap {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.code-textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 340px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  padding: 14px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 2: TEACHING AREA (CENTER — MAIN FOCUS)\n   ========================================================= */\n.area-teaching {\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary-blue-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.06);\n}\n\n.teaching-card-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.teach-step-title {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n.teach-section {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.teach-label {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.teach-code-box {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* Step Calculation Breakdown Box */\n.teach-calc-box {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.calc-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n.calc-label {\n  width: 130px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.calc-val {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 3px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.calc-highlight {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border-color: #bfdbfe;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.calc-after {\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  border-color: var(--changed-green-border);\n  color: var(--changed-green-text);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.teach-meaning-text {\n  font-size: 16.5px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.teach-meaning-text code,\n.teach-next-text code,\n.final-answer-detail code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  color: #1e40af;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.teach-vars-now {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--changed-green-border);\n  color: var(--changed-green-text);\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.teach-next-box {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n}\n\n.teach-next-text {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Final Answer Banner */\n.final-answer-banner {\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  border: 2px solid #10b981;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 18px 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.final-answer-heading {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #065f46;\n}\n\n.final-answer-detail {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #047857;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 3: VARIABLE VALUES (RIGHT)\n   ========================================================= */\n.simple-var-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.simple-var-table th {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n}\n\n.simple-var-table td {\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n.simple-var-table tr.var-row-changed {\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.changed-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: #10b981;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  margin-left: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Clean Input List Display */\n.visual-list-wrap {\n  margin-top: 18px;\n}\n\n.list-card-title {\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.list-cells {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.list-item-cell {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  min-width: 38px;\n  padding: 6px 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.list-item-cell.is-active-num {\n  background: var(--current-line-bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.cell-idx {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.cell-val {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (BOTTOM)\n   ========================================================= */\n.advanced-drawer {\n  margin: 0 28px 28px 28px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.advanced-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n}\n\n.adv-meta {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.advanced-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.adv-box {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 12px;\n}\n\n.adv-title {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.adv-body {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.adv-flowchart {\n  max-height: 240px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 1100px) {\n  .three-area-workspace {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .advanced-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Update styles.css with a clean, light, readable \"Teach Me This Code\" beginner design","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\styles.css","toolAction":"Updating styles.css to light beginner theme","toolSummary":"Update styles.css with light theme and large readable typography"}}]}
